                if (v0 = 42) {
                    [     I have been here for more days than I am able to remember, though I have not forgotten the day I entered this forsaken cave which has become my tomb. That was 2-29-0227. But my food ran out long ago, and the rats are more interested in eating me than letting me eat them. My strength is gone, as is my will. If thou dost find this, please tell Mythra I love her.];
                    [     --Denyel];
                }
                switch v0 {
                    case 43 {
                        [~     Lord British's Last Will and Testament:~~];
                        [     Being of sound mind and body, I hereby bequeath all of my belongings to... Nell, my beloved chambermaid. She has kept me warm so many nights, which is more than I can say for most of my bloody subjects! And to our unborn child, I bequeath my crown. Long live the king. Or queen, whichever it shall be!~~];
                        [          Lord British];
